    - Added a new `metric_types` section documenting 39 `METRIC_TYPE_*` constants from `crates/vox-telemetry/src/types.rs`.
    - Each metric type entry includes its `id`, `constant` name, `owner_crate`, `sensitivity` (S0, S1, or S2), and a one-line `description` from the Rust docstring.
